!
! This test calculates the spin-orbit components of the 2P state of Fluorine,
! using a COSCI wavefunction.
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Fluorine atom.
.WAVE F
**GENERAL
.PCMOUT
**HAMILTONIAN
#.LVCORR
.BSS
2012
.CMPEIG
.PRINT
2
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RESOLVE
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
4 0
.OPEN S
1
5/0,6
.MAXITR
25
*END OF

 $GOSCIP IPRNT=5 &END


    **************************************************************************
    ***************************** Fluorine atom. *****************************
    **************************************************************************

 Jobs in this run:
   * Wave function


